"Delete your Tenon Account from Settings. Tenon verifies your identity and asks you to confirm before deleting central account information and revoking available Apple sign-in tokens. This affects all Tenon products. Your Apple-stored notebook and recovery key are managed separately and are not deleted by Tenon." = "可在设置中进入“删除 Tenon 账号”。Tenon 会重新验证身份，并在你确认后删除中央账号资料、撤销可用的 Apple 登录令牌。这会影响所有 Tenon 产品。Apple 私有存储中的密码本与恢复密钥分别管理，不会由 Tenon 删除。";

"One Tenon Account" = "统一使用 Tenon 账号";
"Enter your recovery key to open your notebook on this iPhone." = "输入恢复密钥，在这台 iPhone 上打开密码本。";
"Your notebook is encrypted before it syncs." = "密码本先在设备上加密，再同步。";
