"Sync details" = "同步详情";
"Tenon manages your sign-in methods. PassBy account sessions last up to 30 days after verification. A rotating sign-in credential in this iPhone’s device-only Keychain securely renews the session. Closing the app does not sign you out. Sign out, credential revocation or 30 days without renewal may require a new sign-in. Face ID is still required to open the notebook, including offline. No passwords or recovery keys are sent to the account service." = "Tenon 管理登录方式。PassBy 账号会话在验证成功后有效 30 天，使用保存在这台 iPhone 本机钥匙串中的轮换凭据安全续期。关闭应用不会退出账号。主动退出、凭据被撤销或 30 天未续期后，可能需要重新登录。打开密码本仍需 Face ID，离线也可使用；账号服务不接收密码或恢复密钥。";
"Tenon processes your email, display name, account identifier and login security records for authentication and account management. PassBy receives verified identity details to establish and securely renew its account session. These are linked to your account and are not used for advertising or tracking. Notebook contents and recovery keys are never sent to Tenon." = "Tenon 为身份验证与账号管理处理邮箱、称呼、账号标识及登录安全记录。PassBy 接收已验证的身份信息，建立并安全续期账号会话。这些信息关联账号，不用于广告或追踪。密码本内容与恢复密钥不会发送给 Tenon。";
"Stay signed in to Tenon. Use Face ID each time you open your notebook. Manage your sign-in methods in Tenon Account." = "保持 Tenon 登录，每次打开密码本使用 Face ID。在 Tenon 账号中心管理登录方式。";
